  "description": "A volume from 0 to 100, set by dragging the thumb or clicking the track; arrow keys move it by 5, Page Up and Page Down by 10, Home and End to the ends. Hover rings the thumb in sand and Dragging in peach; Focus is the 2 px ink ring 2 px outside the thumb, as on every control. The thumb travels inside the track, so at 0 and at 100 it stays whole. Muted is dimmed as a disabled control is, but still works: moving it turns the sound back on.",
